veena-mlx-port
An MLX port of Veena (Hindi and English text to speech) for Apple silicon.

Ported from the official route on Maya Research's model card for Veena
(https://huggingface.co/maya-research/Veena, Apache License 2.0): Hugging Face
transformers' Llama and sampling code (Apache License 2.0) and the SNAC codec
(https://github.com/hubertsiuzdak/snac, MIT License). Model weights are not
included in this repository.

